  "title": "Liars & Leeches",
  "subtitle": "",
  "description": "Grief. Anxiety. Terror. Tonya Wright felt it all after the tragic murders of her sister and brother-in-law in a random act of gun violence. Struggling to travel outside of her home, she now lives constantly on edge about perceived threats that seem to surround her. Retreating to the house her sister and brother-in-law once shared to process her grief, Tonya soon discovers that someone — or something — has followed her there. With the help of her best friend Natalie, and others she meets along the way, can Tonya overcome her fears before they completely consume her? The first original audio drama from Hemlock Creek Productions, “Liars & Leeches” is a fictional horror podcast that delves deep into the complicated horrors of grief, trauma, resilience, and steadfast human determination to uncover the truth. Hosted on Acast. See acast.com/privacy for more information.",
